WEBVTT

00:17:59.527 --> 00:18:01.558
in trying to make
the world a better place.

00:18:01.582 --> 00:18:04.426
But there is also a passionate
commitment to the truth.

00:18:04.999 --> 00:18:09.873
And so I think the answer is to use
that passionate commitment to the truth

00:18:09.897 --> 00:18:12.740
to try to turn it
into a better future for us all.

00:18:12.764 --> 00:18:13.976
Thank you.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:19.253
(Applause)